  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Multi-Donor Trust Fund for Africa&apos;s Digital Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The AU&#x2019;s &#x201d;Moonshot&#x201d; ambition, that African individuals, businesses and institutions should be digitally enabled by 2030, is supported through contributions to the DDP. The contribution funds a number of thematic studies and country diagnostics performed by the World Bank in order to prepare for bankable and fundable projects that contribute to Africa&#x2019;s digitization within digital infrastructure, digital skills, digital platforms, digital financial solutions and digital entrepreneurship.</narrative>
  </description>
